To generate Assets.car for the macOS icons:

xcrun actool \
  --compile ./vivaldi_final/mac/ \
  --platform macosx \
  --minimum-deployment-target 11.0 \
  --app-icon AppIcon \
  --output-partial-info-plist /dev/null \
  ./vivaldi_final/mac/Assets.xcassets

Replacing "vivaldi_final" with "vivaldi_sopranos"/"vivaldi_snapshot" as appropriate.

Note: the tool wants to generate a partial plist, which we can discard,
but we must provide the output path even if we don't want it.
